      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好厉害的比赛……！\n这场“每日王冠”，\n无疑会成为传说……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7a2a8eb7389cafe1ecd023e1232ed6807c86b76421258bc2f4166f5c306bc69",
