      "uid": "zhcn:913874c9f280bed905964aed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是……\n我不能让稻荷一因此崩溃。\n绝对不能让这种状况发生。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a5b4c19a9bc4ef8e220920f02287e7fc5c6c0d9661cebb0d216dfd94c7ab08d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
